    "body": "## Summary\n- add authenticated `GET /saved-searches/{id}/results` for owned radius presets\n- apply saved text/category/price/radius criteria together in PostgreSQL/PostGIS instead of copying private coordinates into a public URL\n- return only public job fields plus computed distance, never the saved center or private address/tracking data\n- render radius-preset results inline in `/saved-searches`; non-radius presets keep their shareable public discovery links\n- add backend coverage and update discovery/privacy documentation\n\n## Privacy / safety\n- ownership is resolved before querying results\n- saved center coordinates remain server-side behind the authenticated saved-search boundary\n- exact addresses, route geometry and participant-only tracking are not returned\n- result limit is validated to 1–100 and only `OPEN` jobs participate\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven tests, frontend lint/build, Flyway/PostGIS runtime and existing payments/runtime gates. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
